{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":67,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ. ܒܩܝܬܪ̈ܐ. ܡܙܡܘܪܐ. ܙܡܪܬ‌ܐ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܗܵܘܹܐ ܚܲܢܵܢܵܐ ܐܸܠܲܢ ܘܒܲܪܸܟ݂ ܠܲܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܲܗܪܸܢ ܦܵܬܹܗ ܠܟܸܣܠܲܢ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܒ݂ܘܿܩ ܦܵܝܫܵܐ ܝܕܝܼܥܬܵ‌ܐ ܒܐܲܪܥܵܐ ܐܘܼܪܚܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܐܸܡܘܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ ܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܲܟܪܝܼ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܥܲܡܡܹ̈ܐ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܲܟܪܝܼ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܥܲܡܡܹ̈ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܚܵܕܝܼ ܘܫܲܒܚܝܼ ܐܸܡܘܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܟܹܐ ܕܵܝܢܹܬ ܥܲܡܡܹ̈ܐ ܒܬܪܘܼܨܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܐܸܡܘܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ ܒܐܲܪܥܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܡܕܲܒܪܸܬ ܠܗܘܿܢ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܲܟܪܝܼ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܥܲܡܡܹ̈ܐ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܲܟܪܝܼ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܥܲܡܡܹ̈ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܪܥܵܐ ܝܘܼܗܒܹܠܔ ܠܵܗ̇ ܛܥܘܼܢܬܘܼܗ̇،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܒܲܪܸܟ݂ ܠܲܢ، ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܐܲܠܵܗܲܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܒܲܪܸܟ݂ ܠܲܢ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܟܹܐ ܙܵܕܥܝܼ ܡܸܢܹܗ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܡܲܪ̈ܙܵܢܹܐ ܕܐܲܪܥܵܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/67.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/68.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/66.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}